   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In September 2020, the Department for Environment, Food and Rural Affairs (Defra), commissioned Ecorys to undertake an evaluation of the Darwin Initiative, Darwin Plus and Illegal Wildlife Trade Challenge Fund (IWTCF) funds. As part of the evaluation, an objective is to make suggestions for establishing effective monitoring and evaluation systems. This report contains insights and recommendations to aid Defra&#x2019;s future development of monitoring, evaluation and learning (MEL) for the three funds, and progresses as follows.</narrative>
